title: "Patent network growth: transitive closure and target reuse"
abstract: >-
  Python and Jupyter workflow for CPC-defined patent citation networks,
  historical attachment opportunities, constrained temporal ensembles,
  chronological growth models, diffusion, connectivity, and publication figures.
